This repository is a throughline *source*: a requirements graph, not a program. It
re-expresses Docker's Dockerfile best practices as a grounded IDD graph so consuming
projects can compose it with throughline.

Docker's documentation, including the Dockerfile best practices, is published by Docker
Inc. under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The rule text re-expressed here in items'
`text`/`attrs.source_ref` is derived from that documentation and remains the work of
Docker Inc. and its contributors; this repository claims no ownership over that content
and reproduces it for interoperability. See
https://docs.docker.com/build/building/best-practices/ for the authoritative source.
